@* Root-namespace types (GridColumn, ColumnType) resolve via the parent-namespace walk
   with no @using at all. If a sub-namespace is ever needed here, write it as
   @using global::ExGrid.Columns — Razor emits usings INSIDE namespace ExGrid.Components,
   where a plain "ExGrid.Columns" is looked up against sibling types first (the CS0426
   trap recorded in AGENTS.md). *@
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components
@* Required for @@onscroll and friends to compile as event handlers rather than as
   plain HTML attributes: the [EventHandler] declarations live in this namespace, and
   without it the markup builds and renders while quietly listening to nothing. *@
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
